---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Potensi Desa | Desa Citarik"
  description="Potensi Desa Citarik: pertanian, perikanan, sumber daya manusia, dan peluang kemitraan."
>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero__media">
    <img src="/images/nelayan.png" alt="Nelayan dan potensi laut Desa Citarik" />
  </div>
  <div class="page-hero__overlay"></div>
  <div class="page-hero__content">
    <div class="container-page">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Beranda</a>
        <i data-lucide="chevron-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
        <span class="font-medium text-white">Potensi Desa</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-extrabold mt-1.5">Potensi Desa Citarik</h1>
      <p class="text-white/85 mt-1.5 max-w-xl">Sumber daya dan peluang ekonomi yang menanti mitra & pembeli.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container-page py-10 md:py-12 space-y-5">

  <article class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-0 items-stretch card-surface overflow-hidden">
    <a href="/potensi/perikanan" class="block aspect-[16/11] md:aspect-auto overflow-hidden">
      <img src="/images/ikan_bakar.png" alt="Perikanan dan nelayan Desa Citarik"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy" />
    </a>
    <div class="p-7">
      <span class="chip chip-potensi">Perikanan</span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-extrabold text-primary mt-2.5">
        <a href="/potensi/perikanan" class="hover:underline">Perikanan</a>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">Menurut Prodeskel 2025: empang/kolam, alat pancing, serta produksi ikan mas dan nila. Pemasaran melalui pasar, KUD, dan lumbung desa.</p>
      <a href="/potensi/perikanan" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-4 text-accent font-heading font-semibold hover:text-primary transition-colors">
        Selengkapnya <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-0 items-stretch card-surface overflow-hidden">
    <a href="/potensi/pertanian" class="block aspect-[16/11] md:aspect-auto md:order-2 overflow-hidden">
      <img src="/images/kebun_sayur.png" alt="Pertanian dan perkebunan Desa Citarik"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy" />
    </a>
    <div class="p-7 md:order-1">
      <span class="chip chip-umkm">Pertanian</span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-extrabold text-primary mt-2.5">
        <a href="/potensi/pertanian" class="hover:underline">Pertanian & Perkebunan</a>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">Prodeskel 2025: 773 keluarga petani, 2.330 Ha tanah sawah, padi sawah 53 Ha (±26 ton/ha), dan budidaya pisang. Peluang kemitraan pertanian terbuka.</p>
      <a href="/potensi/pertanian" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-4 text-accent font-heading font-semibold hover:text-primary transition-colors">
        Selengkapnya <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-0 items-stretch card-surface overflow-hidden">
    <a href="/potensi/sdm" class="block aspect-[16/11] md:aspect-auto overflow-hidden">
      <img src="/images/nelayan.png" alt="Warga dan organisasi masyarakat Desa Citarik"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy" />
    </a>
    <div class="p-7">
      <span class="chip chip-kuliner">Sumber Daya Manusia</span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-extrabold text-primary mt-2.5">
        <a href="/potensi/sdm" class="hover:underline">Potensi Sumber Daya Manusia</a>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">8.553 warga usia 18–56 tahun bekerja, 4 dusun, 10 RW, 50 RT, BPD 9 anggota, LPMD, dan BUMDes — fondasi kelembagaan desa (Prodeskel & rekap PEMDES 2025).</p>
      <a href="/potensi/sdm" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-4 text-accent font-heading font-semibold hover:text-primary transition-colors">
        Selengkapnya <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <div class="bg-primary text-white rounded-xl p-8 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-extrabold text-white">Tertarik bermitra dengan Desa Citarik?</h2>
    <p class="text-white/80 mt-2 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Hubungi pemerintah desa untuk informasi investasi, kemitraan, atau kerja sama potensi desa.</p>
    <a href="/kontak" class="btn mt-5 bg-white text-primary hover:bg-sand border border-transparent">
      <i data-lucide="phone" class="w-5 h-5"></i> Hubungi Desa
    </a>
  </div>

</div>

</Layout>
